WEBVTT

00:01:29.096 --> 00:01:32.601
That's contrasted with other
start-ups that do 997.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.640
(Music)

00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:36.518
CA: Kai-Fu and I are going to discuss

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:40.107
how China's gladiatorial
fight to the death

00:01:40.131 --> 00:01:44.375
has made China better positioned
to lead the world in the AI race.

00:01:44.923 --> 00:01:48.361
Also, the amazing ways
AI is already being incorporated

00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:50.418
into China's everyday life,

00:01:50.442 --> 00:01:54.204
the massive risk of disruption
to our economies,

00:01:54.228 --> 00:01:55.938
and a beautiful way of thinking

00:01:55.962 --> 00:02:00.609
about how AI could actually enhance
the future of human work.